    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul><li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14)\">@Check[type:intimidation|dc:22|name:Twice to cow the Manticore|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert) </span>Twice to Cow the Manticore</li><li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14)\">@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name:Once to quiet the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert) </span>Once to Quiet the Spirit</li><li><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14)\">@Check[type:religion|dc:20|name:Once to quiet the Spirit|traits:complex,haunt,hazard] (expert) Once to Quiet the Spirit</span></li></ul>",
      "description": "<p><strong>Burning Haunt</strong>: This Haunt only targets creatures haunted by Cyralie Foxglove, who tried to burn the manor  to stop her husband from being driven mad. If no creatures in a group are haunted by Cyralie Foxglove the haunt may target any creature.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatically resets after one day until the supernatural Fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p>Valid Creature that has entered B2 previously enters B2 again; The haunt rolls its stealth against targets perception DC. On a success the burning manticore makes a burning tail strike. After the attack or after a failure the Burning Manticore rolls initiative.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Routine</strong> The haunt moves toward its target at a speed of 40 feet. If it has any actions left after its movement it makes a strike its stinger against its target.</p>\n<p>If the target is struck successfully, it must make a&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:reflex|dc:25|name:Lured to Ashes Fire|traits:damaging-effect,fire,necromancy,occult]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">save or take&nbsp;</span>[[/r 1d8[persistent,fire]]] damage.</p>",
